 "summary": "Mostly no. Most Combined Ratings settings did no better than random entries on BTC, ETH and SOL, and a fresh Buy on daily did 2.83% worse. The result that holds up is the fresh Strong Buy on 4h: price beat random entries by 1.37% after 20 candles, held without its strongest episode and at 10, 50 and 100 candles, though SOL carries most of it.",
 "verdicts": [
  {
   "use": "Going long on a fresh Strong Buy",
