  },
  {
   "use": "Staying long while CR reads Strong Buy",
   "verdict": "edge",
   "text": "Beat random entries by 0.14% on 1h and 0.68% on 4h after 20 candles, and both held without their strongest stretch. On daily it sat inside the luck band."
  },
  {
   "use": "Staying long while CR reads Buy or Strong Buy",
