 "notes": [
  "A fresh Strong Buy on 4h gave 394 entries in 272 separate moves. Twenty candles later price was 1.37% ahead of random entries, and the gap held without its strongest episode. SOL carries most of it at 2.66%, while BTC at 0.61% and ETH at 0.94% stay inside their luck bands. On 1h the same signal fires far more often and lands inside the band at 0.08%.",
  "Staying long on every candle that reads Strong Buy beat random entries by 0.14% on 1h and 0.68% on 4h. Both hold without their strongest stretch and at 10, 20, 50 and 100 candles. Per coin it is thinner: on 1h only SOL clears its band, at 0.26%, and ETH's 0.12% depends on signals between Dec 25, 2020 and Jan 10, 2021. On 4h, SOL's 1.22% alone vanishes without the stretch between Jul 29, 2021 and Sep 11, 2021.",
  "Adding plain Buy readings dilutes the signal. On 4h, Buy or Strong Buy on every candle enters about three times as often as Strong Buy alone. Its 0.3% gap disappears without the stretch between Dec 25, 2020 and May 21, 2021. On 1h its 81,097 entries landed inside the luck band, and a fresh Buy on 1h or 4h was no different from random.",
  "On daily, a fresh Buy gave 368 entries in 98 moves and did 2.83% worse than random after 20 days. The gap holds without its strongest stretch and shows again at 100 days, but not at 10 or 50. Daily Strong Buy and Strong Sell signals are rare: per coin they stay under 30 separate moves, too few to judge.",
  "On the short side, a fresh Strong Sell on 1h beat random shorts by 0.26% after 20 candles, with 1,795 entries in 1,197 moves. It holds without its strongest episode and at 10 and 50 candles, but fades by 100. No single coin clears its own band. Sell or Strong Sell on every 4h candle looked better by 0.28%, but only because of the stretch between Apr 4, 2022 and Jun 22, 2022.",
  "On a long bot, a fresh 4h Strong Buy fits as a filter beside your own start condition, not as the trigger. Test it on your pair first, because SOL carries most of the result. The gap showed from 10 to 100 candles, so it pairs with a take profit that has room to fill rather than a tight scalp. A fresh Buy on daily is a reason to leave that setting out of a long bot, and only the 1h fresh Strong Sell showed anything for a short bot's timing."
 ],
